It contains the schema of the ViaFrei database and the service that migrates
and checks it; it contains no data. The tables are shaped for open data from
German public sources (traffic, public transport, fuel, charging, parking,
weather warnings, places). Each of those sources carries its own licence and
attribution, and some are share-alike or purpose-limited. Those terms apply to
the data you load, whatever this licence says about the code.
